---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">matcha · musings · moving home</p>
    <h1>Whisked Away</h1>
    <p class="sub">Notes from a chronic overthinker — on matcha, books, long-distance love, being one of three women in the room, and moving 8,000 km back home to India.</p>
    <div class="hero-tags">
      <span>🍵 matcha logs</span>
      <span>🌀 random thoughts</span>
      <span>📚 currently reading</span>
      <span>💌 long distance</span>
      <span>🇮🇳 moving back</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="posts">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% set featured = collections.posts | first %}
    {% if featured %}
    <div class="featured">
      <div class="featured-art">
        {% if featured.data.cover %}<img src="{{ featured.data.cover }}" alt="{{ featured.data.title }}">{% else %}"{{ featured.data.emoji or '🍵' }} the whisk always knows"{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="cat">{{ featured.data.category }}</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ featured.url }}">{{ featured.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ featured.data.description }}</p>
        <p class="meta">{{ featured.date | niceDate }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Latest Posts</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index > 1 %}
      <article class="card">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}"><div class="card-art">
          {% if post.data.cover %}<img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}">{% else %}{{ post.data.emoji or '🍵' }}{% endif %}
        </div></a>
        <span class="cat">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <p class="meta">{{ post.date | niceDate }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" style="background:var(--matcha-mist);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="portrait">"powered by matcha<br>& mild chaos"</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Hi, I'm Ruthu 🍃</h2>
        <p>I spent four years abroad after undergrad, collected a degree, a long-distance boyfriend, and a matcha dependency — then packed it all up (minus the boyfriend, he's still in a different time zone, tragically) and moved back to India.</p>
        <p>By day I work in a field where I'm usually the only woman in the room. By night I read too much, think about <em>deeply unserious questions</em> with complete seriousness, and whisk green powder into things.</p>
        <p>If you've ever moved home and felt like a tourist in your own country, loved someone across an ocean, or wondered why we park in driveways and drive on parkways — you'll fit right in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="newsletter">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="newsletter">
      <h2>The Sunday Steep</h2>
      <p>One email a week: what I wrote, what I read, one random thought, and whatever matcha I'm currently obsessed with. Free, forever-ish.</p>
      <form class="nl-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<p style=\'color:#fff;font-size:1rem\'>🍵 You\'re in! Check your inbox on Sunday.</p>'">
        <input type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required>
        <button type="submit">Steep me in</button>
      </form>
      <p class="nl-note">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime (but why would you).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="support" class="support-strip">
  <h2>Enjoying the chaos?</h2>
  <p>This blog runs on matcha and stubbornness. If a post made you smile, you can fuel the next one.</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn">☕ Buy me a matcha</a>
  <a href="#newsletter" class="btn ghost">Join the newsletter</a>
</section>
